#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:107
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "Warktüüch för't Övermalen vun Fotos"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:108
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr ""
"Du muttst en Rebeet för't Övermalen utsöken, wenn Du dit Warktüüch bruken wullt"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:118 imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:135
msgid "Photograph Inpainting"
msgstr "Foto övermalen"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:137
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to inpaint a photograph."
msgstr "En digiKam-Moduul för de Bildkorrektuur dör Övermalen."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:143
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:146
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "\"CImg\"-Bibliotheek"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:149
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Torüchmellen un Moduul-Överarbeiden"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:162
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Vörinstellen"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:170
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Nettsiet vun de \"CImg\"-Bibliotheek besöken"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:172
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "Filter-Typ:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:175
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keen"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:176
msgid "Remove Small Artefact"
msgstr "Lütt Objekt wegmaken"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:177
msgid "Remove Medium Artefact"
msgstr "Middelgroot Objekt wegmaken"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:178
msgid "Remove Large Artefact"
msgstr "Groot Objekt wegmaken"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:179
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default."
"<p><b>Remove Small Artefact</b>: inpaint small image artefact like image "
"glitch."
"<p><b>Remove Medium Artefact</b>: inpaint medium image artefact."
"<p><b>Remove Large Artefact</b>: inpaint image artefact like unwanted object."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den vörinstellt Filter utsöken, den Du för't Foto bruken "
"wullt:"
"<p><b>Keen</b>: Tomehrst bruukte Weerten, sett allens op de Vörinstellen."
"<p><b>Lütt Objekt wegdoon</b>: övermaalt lütte Objekten, as t.B. Bildfehlers."
"<p><b>Middelgroot Objekt wegdoon</b>: övermaalt middelgrote Objekten."
"<p><b>Groot Objekt wegdoon</b>: övermaalt grote (t.B. leegleden) Objekten."
"<p>"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:394
msgid "InPainting"
msgstr "Övermalen"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:401
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Övermaalinstellen-Datei laden"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:412
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Inpainting settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" is keen Övermaalinstellen-Textdatei."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:419
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich ut de Övermaalinstellen-Textdatei laden."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:428
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Övermaalinstellen-Datei sekern"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:437
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich na de Övermaalinstellen-Textdatei sekern."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:41
msgid "Inpainting..."
msgstr "Övermalen..."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:46
msgid ""
"This filter can be used to inpaint a part in a photo. Select a region to "
"inpaint to use this option."
msgstr ""
"Mit dissen Filter lett sik en Deel vun en Foto övermalen. Söök en Rebeet ut, "
"dat Du mit disse Funkschoon övermalen wullt."

#. i18n: file digikamimageplugin_inpainting_ui.rc line 7
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fi&x"
msgstr "&Richten"

#~ msgid "&Save As..."
#~ msgstr "&Sekern as..."

#~ msgid "&Load..."
#~ msgstr "&Laden..."

#~ msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
#~ msgstr "<p>All Parameters op ehr Standardweerten torüchsetten"

#~ msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
#~ msgstr "<p>All Filterparameters ut Instellen-Textdatei laden"

#~ msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
#~ msgstr "<p>All Filterparameters na Instellen-Textdatei sekern"

#~ msgid "Plugin Handbook"
#~ msgstr "Moduul-Handbook"

#~ msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
#~ msgstr "<p>Dit is dat Vörankamen för de aktuelle Opgaav in Perzent."

#~ msgid "Smoothing"
#~ msgstr "Weekmaken"

#~ msgid "Detail preservation:"
#~ msgstr "Enkelheiten wohren:"

#~ msgid "<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
#~ msgstr "<p>\"Enkelheiten wohren\" leggt de Scharpteek-Stoop för lütte Objekten binnen dat Teelbild fast. Grötter Weerten maakt disse Enkelheiten scharp."

#~ msgid "Anisotropy:"
#~ msgstr "Richtenafhangigkeit:"

#~ msgid "<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for Gaussian noise."
#~ msgstr "<p>Richtenafhangen Modifikator för Enkelheiten. Laat em lütt, vun wegen dat Gauß'sche Rusen."

#~ msgid "Smoothing:"
#~ msgstr "Weekmaken:"

#~ msgid "<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
#~ msgstr "<p>Heel Weekmaak-Stärk: Wenn de Enkelheiten-Faktor dat relative Weekmaken fastleggt, un de Övergangfaktor de Richt, denn leggt de Tietschritt den helen Effekt fast."

#~ msgid "Regularity:"
#~ msgstr "Regelmatigkeit:"

#~ msgid "<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
#~ msgstr "<p>Disse Weert stüert de Weekmaak-Regelmatigkeit vun dat Teelbild. Bruuk hier keen hogen Weert, wiel sünst dat Teelbild heel verwischt warrt."

#~ msgid "Iterations:"
#~ msgstr "Wedderhalen:"

#~ msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
#~ msgstr "<p>Leggt fast, wo faken de Filter op dat Teelbild anwendt warrt."

#~ msgid "Advanced Settings"
#~ msgstr "Verwiedert Instellen"

#~ msgid "Angular step:"
#~ msgstr "Winkelschritt:"

#~ msgid "<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
#~ msgstr "<p>Leggt den Integratschoon-Winkelschritt in Graad fast, analoog to de Richtenafhangigkeit."

#~ msgid "Integral step:"
#~ msgstr "Integraalschritt:"

#~ msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
#~ msgstr "<p>Leggt den Ruum-Integraalschritt fast. Bliev ünner 1."

#~ msgid "Gaussian:"
#~ msgstr "Gauß'sch:"

#~ msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
#~ msgstr "<p>Leggt de Nauigkeit vun de Gauß'sch Funkschoon fast."

#~ msgid "Use linear interpolation"
#~ msgstr "Lineaar Estemeren bruken"

#~ msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
#~ msgstr "<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat leste Beten an Gööd rutquetschen wullt (langsam)."

#~ msgid "Normalize photograph"
#~ msgstr "Foto normaliseren"

#~ msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
#~ msgstr "<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat Utgaavbild normaliseren wullt."
